WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.824
WET. Hands are under safe clean running water.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.720
SOAP. Rub palms and between fingers for about 20 seconds.

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:10.709
RINSE. Clean water takes soap away.

00:00:12.533 --> 00:00:15.136
DRY. Hands are dried before food is handled.
